OL,3,GNEWSAThree more arrests after woman
OL,4,Astabbed to death
OL,5,
OL,6,FThree more arrests have been made in
OL,7,Fconnection with the suspected murder of
OL,8,Fa woman who was stabbed in a street in
OL,9,FManchester.
OL,11,FAlisha Samuels, 26, was found dead
OL,12,Fafter officers were called to a
OL,13,Fdisturbance on Dorking Avenue in the
OL,14,FNewton Heath area of the city at about
OL,15,F02:00 BST on Thursday.
OL,17,FOn Tuesday, Lawrence Johnson, 26, of
OL,18,FDorking Avenue, was charged with the
OL,19,Fmurder of Samuels and the attempted
OL,20,Fmurder of a man.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB NW Eng NewsC Reg TVF Weather
FL,409,400,260,160,0,100
